    {"id":"rationale_classifier_is_candidate_not_semantic_truth","label":"分类器输出只是候选路由","file_type":"rationale","source_file":"D:\\Temp\\create_skills\\bingbingxiaomei-perspective\\evals\\METHODOLOGY.md","source_location":"当前 taxonomy 分类评估边界","source_url":null,"captured_at":null,"author":null,"contributor":null,"rationale":"分类器输出不是语义真值；低置信或 unresolved 文章须进入人工原文复核，pending 不可计为通过。"},
    {"id":"rationale_explicit_unresolved_honesty_boundary","label":"显式 unresolved 诚实边界","file_type":"rationale","source_file":"D:\\Temp\\create_skills\\bingbingxiaomei-perspective\\evals\\METHODOLOGY.md","source_location":"当前 taxonomy 分类评估边界","source_url":null,"captured_at":null,"author":null,"contributor":null,"rationale":"正式裁决保留的 unresolved 是完成复核后的诚实边界，不表示待审查遗漏。"},
